{"turn_id": "d05-t1", "session_id": "d05", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "f1_metric", "text": "端到端查询生成任务使用平均 F1 分数（average F1-scores）作为评估指标。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.11053", "chunk_id": "c-daf5d703e596aabb1fd2bc1b"}]}, {"key": "precision_recall", "text": "SubQG 在不同训练数据规模下的表现通过 precision 和 recall 进行评估与报告。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.11053", "chunk_id": "c-e3d8e85b61e47d299326d16b"}]}, {"key": "top1_top5", "text": "分析中报告了 top-1 和 top-5 输出中正确生成查询的比例。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.11053", "chunk_id": "c-e3d8e85b61e47d299326d16b"}]}, {"key": "substructure_acc", "text": "对于查询子结构预测的替代网络，使用 accuracy 作为评估指标。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.11053", "chunk_id": "c-888ad445b4684a4dd148f450"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d05-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d05-t2", "session_id": "d05", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "avg_f1_metric", "text": "端到端查询生成任务的结果以平均 F1 分数（average F1-scores）报告。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.11053", "chunk_id": "c-daf5d703e596aabb1fd2bc1b"}]}, {"key": "gold_linking", "text": "这些端到端结果均以金标准实体/关系链接结果作为输入。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.11053", "chunk_id": "c-daf5d703e596aabb1fd2bc1b"}]}, {"key": "outperform", "text": "SubQG 在两个数据集上都优于所有对比方法，并且与 CompQA 相比，在复杂问题上取得更显著的提升。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.11053", "chunk_id": "c-daf5d703e596aabb1fd2bc1b"}]}, {"key": "abstract_superior", "text": "作者称在两个基准数据集上的实验表明该方法显著优于现有方法，尤其在复杂问题上，并在有限训练数据和带噪声的实体/关系链接结果下取得有希望的表现。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.11053", "chunk_id": "c-0db9bdf4621706e238cbc3b6"}]}, {"key": "noise_top5", "text": "在将正确链接结果与 EARL 生成的 top-5 候选混合的噪声设置下，首个输出的 precision 下降 11.4%，但在 85% 的情况下仍能在 top-5 中生成正确答案。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.11053", "chunk_id": "c-e3d8e85b61e47d299326d16b"}]}, {"key": "earl_only", "text": "仅使用 EARL 链接结果时性能相比前两行大幅下降；作者称对于 82.8% 的问题 EARL 提供了部分正确结果，而考虑剩余问题时系统在 top-1 和 top-5 输出中分别有 73.2% 和 84.8% 的正确生成查询。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.11053", "chunk_id": "c-e3d8e85b61e47d299326d16b"}]}, {"key": "training_data", "text": "在 LC-QuAD 上，随着训练数据增加，基于查询子结构的方法在 precision 和 recall 上均获得稳定提升；合并模块略微损害整体 precision，但对 recall 提升更大，尤其在训练数据很少时。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.11053", "chunk_id": "c-e3d8e85b61e47d299326d16b"}]}, {"key": "no_accuracy_topk_values", "text": "提供的证据片段未给出 accuracy 指标或具体的 top-1/top-5 precision、recall 数值（相关数值在未提供的表格中）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.11053", "chunk_id": "c-daf5d703e596aabb1fd2bc1b"}, {"paper_id": "1908.11053", "chunk_id": "c-e3d8e85b61e47d299326d16b"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d05-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_corre